<title>USA: Susquehanna Q3 shr falls with SAIF charge.</title>
<headline>Susquehanna Q3 shr falls with SAIF charge.</headline>
<dateline>LITITZ, Pa. 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.39		    $0.62</p>
<p> Net		 5,109		    7,249</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  13,173		   11,641</p>
<p>	  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr		 $1.63		    $1.62</p>
<p> Net		 21,464		   18,868</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  13,157		   11,638</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: The current quarter includes a one-time, before-tax charge of $5.5 million to pay for recapitalization of the Savings Association Insurance Fund. Excluding the charge, net income for the quarter would have been $8.427 million or $0.64 per share.</p>
</text>
